Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: runtest.c
Line: 1907
Function: pushParseTest
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: xmlCreatePushParserCtxt (or htmlCreatePushParserCtxt in the HTML branch) can return NULL on failure. The code immediately dereferences 'ctxt' via xmlCtxtSetErrorHandler(ctxt, ...) and subsequent calls without checking for NULL.

